00:55:31.460 --> 00:55:31.810
&gt;&gt; We got one.

00:55:31.810 --> 00:55:32.830
&gt;&gt; I came here to get stumped, yeah.

00:55:32.830 --> 00:55:34.546
&gt;&gt; Hi Oprah, my name is Melissa and I
wanted

00:55:34.546 --> 00:55:41.620
